{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921215459_971adae9","chunk_index":6,"job_id":"mwjob_bf28987c132c1b13527f252a","precondition_digest":"67d537499c47fe4ae0d786ec4ac18714b2af7d64fc584e8f1b34e1d9f712899a","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v5","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_786ed871c599f48b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7e45f89bd422b0c","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_4c48871b5365c1fd","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_7a3cc05f07007ef0"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921215459_971adae9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","quote":"年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"84c797ef831faca984b07a887673493311f0f60290bc26e7f120f5a1cc097ca2","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","span_id":"span_inc_sel"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_inc_def"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究人群概述：确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。","quote_sha256":"a8e79e0e0422cd44b88dc3e21e985b80d8a582156f8af354719235edcd236224","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_population"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_inc_sel","span_inc_def","span_population"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"入选标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"受试者须同时满足下列全部条件方可进入本研究：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。上述条件共同界定成人中重度斑块状银屑病的目标人群，疾病严重程度相关指标应分别于筛选期和基线时完成评价，并以两次评估结果支持入组合格性判定。所有入选条件的判定均应基于原始临床资料和检查结果完成。","rationale":"入选条件、疾病严重程度阈值和适用治疗范围均有已确认研究事实支持；医学作者需核对PASI、BSA、sPGA阈值在筛选期与基线的具体判定口径，以及‘适合接受系统治疗或光疗’的操作性定义。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（入选标准），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_786ed871c599f48b","section_number":"5.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921215459_971adae9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","quote":"非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"6a5ef52f93bbc528e24021047a64c1487734e0d2db670c7bce4e12573a9707c3","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","span_id":"span_exc_sel"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_exc_def"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_exc_sel","span_exc_def"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"排除标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"存在下列任一情形的受试者应排除：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效或安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。排除标准的判定应由研究者基于受试者的临床资料完成，重点评估相关情况是否可能影响研究疗效或安全性评价的可靠性。对于‘研究者判断不适合参加’的情形，应结合研究目的、目标人群定义及受试者个体情况审慎作出判断。","rationale":"排除标准条目有已确认研究事实支持；医学作者需明确‘可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病’与‘活动性严重感染’的判定边界，并确认妊娠或哺乳期受试者是否仅在本章节作为排除标准列出。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（排除标准），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7e45f89bd422b0c","section_number":"5.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921215459_971adae9","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_4c48871b5365c1fd","fact_path":"picos.visit_strategy","options":[{"label":"允许重新筛选1次并分配新的筛选编号","option_id":"rescreen_once_new_number","summary":"对因可逆因素或暂时性异常未达标的受试者，允许在研究者评估后重新筛选1次；重新筛选时分配新的筛选编号，并完整保留两次筛选的评估记录。"},{"label":"不安排重新筛选","option_id":"no_rescreen","summary":"筛选失败后不安排重新筛选，相关筛选评估资料按研究记录要求归档。"},{"label":"逐例评估并按可逆性判断是否重新筛选","option_id":"case_by_case","summary":"不预先设定固定重新筛选次数，由研究者根据异常可逆性、受试者合格性变化及个体情况逐例判断是否重新筛选。"}],"question":"筛选失败后是否允许重新筛选，以及重新筛选的次数和编号管理如何设定？","rationale":"现有已确认项目来源未规定重新筛选策略，逐例评估可在不预设固定规则的前提下保留研究者判断空间，最终策略需医学确认。","recommended_option_id":"case_by_case"},{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_4c48871b5365c1fd","fact_path":"picos.assessment_timing_restrictions","options":[{"label":"仅在异常可逆或与病史不一致时允许重复检查","option_id":"repeat_if_reversible","summary":"对筛选期内不符合入选标准或排除标准的检查，若研究者认为异常可能为可逆性改变或与受试者病史不一致，可安排在筛选期内重复检查以支持合格性判定。"},{"label":"不允许重复检查","option_id":"no_repeat","summary":"筛选期内未达标的检查结果直接用于合格性判定，不安排重复检查。"},{"label":"允许在筛选期内重复检查1次","option_id":"repeat_once","summary":"对未达标的检查在筛选期内统一允许重复检查1次，并记录重复检查结果。"}],"question":"筛选期内未达标的检查是否允许重复检查？","rationale":"已确认研究事实未包含筛选期重复检查规则，按异常可逆性判断可在避免预设固定次数的情况下兼顾受试者个体差异，最终规则需医学确认。","recommended_option_id":"repeat_if_reversible"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","quote":"章节标题=筛选失败与重新筛选\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"1be93ac145e3607c2a9704e66ebad4f22ca5687dd870544a1f22286542f41ae5","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","span_id":"span_sec55_empty"},{"locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:460|chunk:1","quote":"筛选失败定义为同意参加临床研究但未被分配至研究治疗中的参与者。在筛选期间，不符合入选标准/符合排除标准的检查，如果研究者认为参与者在重新检查后可能符合要求，则在筛选期间可以重复检查1次。此外，筛选失败的参与者，如果研究者认为参与者入组的合格性发生了变化或任何实验室异常与参与者的病史不一致，参与者可以重新进行1次筛选。必须为重新筛选的参与者分配新的筛选编号。","quote_sha256":"abe327b691816a29b09e2ea049d5e7c9be77469b1d15bea0df6450cb8ea32782","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8","span_id":"span_corpus_rescreen"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec55_empty","span_corpus_rescreen"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"筛选失败与重新筛选","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节用于规定筛选失败的记录方式，以及筛选失败后重新筛选的适用条件与操作要求。对于在筛选评估中未能满足入选标准或存在排除标准的受试者，应作为筛选失败保留相关筛选评估资料。对于筛选期间出现的可逆性异常或与既往病史不一致的检查结果，应由研究者基于受试者的临床资料评估其是否可能满足全部合格性要求。如安排重新筛选，应保持筛选过程的完整性与可追溯性，相关评估结果应能够支持合格性判定。","rationale":"已确认研究事实未包含筛选失败、重新筛选或筛选期重复检查规则；医学作者需确认是否允许重复检查、重新筛选次数及筛选编号管理要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_4c48871b5365c1fd","section_number":"5.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921215459_971adae9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"de95f9be9998127e2809b541909507518ef585264bf64d89df0ca5da01260e14","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_dose_ip"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"6e161fdc710a0a80dfd37e8087ba89849d7bfdb2aa6b1f8d9a2466c304e8fae9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_dose_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_comparator"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"给药途径：口服\n剂型：口服固体制剂\n局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"78600b5eda938590ec7b130e4de65c0c2baa8cd1acfa764ff22fb5b656bd4d14","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_route_form_exposure"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_tech_type"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","quote":"章节标题=研究治疗/干预\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"9938c3a52803328c097a6a2a008bcfea5e27f0b9a7a384cf0c827878a05c3ff4","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","span_id":"span_sec6_empty"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_intervention","span_dose_ip","span_dose_placebo","span_comparator","span_route_form_exposure","span_tech_type","span_sec6_empty"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次（QD），自第1天至第16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂，每日一次（QD）口服，第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。试验组与对照组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。合成试验药A为小分子口服固体制剂，暴露范围为系统暴露。研究期间通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性。","rationale":"给药剂量、频次、疗程、对照设置和依从性评价方式均有已确认研究事实支持；医学作者需确认本章节是否还需补充合并用药、剂量调整或暂停给药等未明确的实施规则。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_7a3cc05f07007ef0","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8d2cd58f850ec6198ec865a8","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"399573590b664fd9f8dbf4c77324f833c1c99888b566fdc7e495fa7afc98bd88"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:妊娠、哺乳与避孕|block:460|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"abe327b691816a29b09e2ea049d5e7c9be77469b1d15bea0df6450cb8ea32782"}]}